WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:09.603
Governments and defence forces face hybrid warfare threats and climate emergencies where conventional telecommunications can be disabled in seconds.

2
00:00:09.953 --> 00:00:19.873
SENDA converts this vulnerability into sovereign autonomy: an ad-hoc tactical network securing command and control without reliance on foreign infrastructure.

3
00:00:21.473 --> 00:00:31.329
While legacy military radios cost tens of thousands of euros, SENDA executes over accessible hardware under twenty-five euros combined with advanced algorithms.

4
00:00:31.679 --> 00:00:41.151
This architecture enables the deployment of thousands of passive sensors, mesh nodes, and counter-drone detectors at a fraction of traditional procurement costs.

5
00:00:42.751 --> 00:00:51.817
Fully aligned with European civil protection directives and the DATEX II standard, SENDA is ready for immediate sovereign and institutional procurement.

6
00:00:52.167 --> 00:01:01.042
A strategic investment merging high-performance software, verified mathematical science, and unmatched technological resilience for sovereign nations.
